  <ym-title|Actual corrected detector powers in
  phases><label|actual-corrected-detector-powers-in-phases>

  Pinned source: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>. Author:
  parent session <verbatim|hairer-codex-existence-20261111>, #26 claim.
  Prose: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/actual-phase-detector-moments.tex>.
  Status: draft, independent review pending.

  <section|Exact scope><label|exact-scope>

  Proves the finite packet and all-power application from the same trial's
  lift/later/Valid.cheap data. Depends explicitly on the actual hierarchy,
  bounded slab operators, their Theme laws, Steady separated-cluster limit,
  and Phase.reflects. The last is a separate real-grid comparison producer;
  this packet proof does not silently assert it. It also retains the finite
  separating tests, eventual spanning and phase respect needed for null-space
  retention, supplied by their separate canonical units.

  <section|Source crosswalk><label|source-crosswalk>

  All paths relative to <verbatim|Lean/YM/>, at the pinned revision.

  <block|<tformat|<twith|table-width|1par>|<twith|table-hmode|exact>|<cwith|1|-1|1|-1|cell-hyphen|t>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-bborder|1ln>|<cwith|1|1|1|-1|cell-valign|bottom>|<table|<row|<cell|<strong|Manuscript
  step>>|<cell|<strong|Inspected source>>>|<row|<cell|Finite polynomial
  packet; same current/point labels, constants, root
  budget>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Bid.Episode>,
  <verbatim|Episode.word/cluster/cuts/Sold/step/twice/flick/price/fromCut/wanted>;
  <verbatim|Bid/Fetch.lean>>>|<row|<cell|Even coarse-cell injection, ordinary
  translation, conjugate root>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.B15.rootTest_star>,
  <verbatim|addr_even>, <verbatim|addr_copy>, <verbatim|addr_inj>,
  <verbatim|addr_root>, <verbatim|cuts_translate>, <verbatim|cutoff_bound>,
  <verbatim|answer>; <verbatim|Work/B15.lean>>>|<row|<cell|Finite expansion,
  eventual genericity, coupled moving-label
  limits>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.B16.steps_apart>,
  <verbatim|translate_generic>, <verbatim|nowSlot_limit>,
  <verbatim|twice_expand>, <verbatim|fromCut_expand>, <verbatim|term_pass>,
  <verbatim|answer>; <verbatim|Work/B16.lean>>>|<row|<cell|Separated-cluster
  limit with ordinary conjugation as adjoint; ordered
  products>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.B17.conj_M>, <verbatim|answer>, immediate
  monomial/rises/alt_prod; <verbatim|Work/B17.lean>, reusing
  <verbatim|YM.OS.Ground.arcs>>>|<row|<cell|Actual unary/binary packets,
  exact cutoff subtract1/subtract2 and limiting Delta
  operators>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Work.B18.answer>, immediate
  enact/first_send/second_send/within_subtract;
  <verbatim|Work/B18.lean>>>|<row|<cell|Epsilon removal, Funds for same
  trial>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Bid.episode>, immediate fees;
  <verbatim|Bid/Fetch.lean>>>|<row|<cell|Every-character
  bounds>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Extraction.Retain.Tall>, <verbatim|bit>,
  <verbatim|Funds>, <verbatim|one_near>, <verbatim|pair_near>;
  <verbatim|Phase/Detect.lean>>>|<row|<cell|Exact unchanged null
  space>|<cell|<verbatim|YM.Extraction.Retain.lift_detect>, immediate
  result/converge; <verbatim|Phase/Picks.lean>; reuses canonical phase-fields
  finite-dimensional proof>>>>>

  The actual binary polynomial is <verbatim|(weigh_j-a_j)(weigh_h-a_h)-cumulant>,
  not an estimate of the product of compressed one-point operators. Packet
  slots retain the row indices even for unit or repeated labels. All
  coefficients are fixed at the comparison trial before cutoff limits. Copy
  count is fixed before taking finite-volume limits; large translation is
  chosen to avoid the finitely many cross-packet coordinate ties. No
  all-power uniform cutoff tail or limit interchange is claimed.

  <section|Reuse, literature and checks><label|reuse-literature-and-checks>

  Reuses actual-rank-purchases, finite-rank-kernel-transport, centered
  planted inequalities, the canonical phases separated-cluster proof, and
  phase-fields moment/finite-detector arguments. Shared background notes and
  their catalog contain no additional applicable packet producer; no new
  external theorem or novelty claim is made. Finite polynomial and
  ordered-product algebra are proved in the prose instead of searching for a
  generic reference.

  Actually inspected with focused sed/cat/rg: Bid/Fetch, Work/B15\UB18,
  Phase/Detect/Picks, the corresponding canonical manuscript passages.
  sha256sum recorded the candidate. No source edit, Lean build or axiom
  replay. TeX build/visual QA and independent source/mathematical review
  pending.

